# Why Blame the Kids? We Teach Mistakes!

**Authors:** Jencks, Stanley M., And Others

## Abstract
Children's difficulties remembering correct algorithms for operations with fractions are traced to difficulties in the instructional sequence. Many teachers &quot;teach mistakes&quot; by failing to provide sufficient referents for their pupils. (MP)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ232918

